---
import Base from "../../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="焊接网护栏 — 3D 护栏、价格与规格" description="安平工厂 3D 焊接护栏网：高度、丝径、涂层、立柱和门。工厂直供价格。" lang="zh">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8">
    <!-- Main Content -->
    <article class="flex-1 min-w-0 prose">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-theme-primary">焊接网护栏</h1>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary">3D 护栏网（折弯焊接网护栏）是全球默认的安防周界围栏：带 V 型折弯的焊接网片，安装在方柱或桃形柱上。安平是全球最大生产基地——全球销售的"欧式围栏"和"3D 护栏"大多产自这里。</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">标准规格</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>高度 (mm)</th><th>网片宽度</th><th>开孔 (mm)</th><th>丝径 (mm)</th><th>立柱</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>1030</td><td>2.5 m / 3.0 m</td><td>50 × 200</td><td>3.0–4.0</td><td>48 × 1.5 mm 圆 / 50×50 方</td></tr>
          <tr><td>1230</td><td>2.5 m / 3.0 m</td><td>50 × 200</td><td>3.5–4.5</td><td>60 × 2.0 mm 圆 / 60×60 方</td></tr>
          <tr><td>1530</td><td>2.5 m / 3.0 m</td><td>50 × 200</td><td>4.0–5.0</td><td>60 × 2.0 mm 圆 / 60×60 方</td></tr>
          <tr><td>1830</td><td>2.5 m / 3.0 m</td><td>50 × 200</td><td>4.5–5.0</td><td>60 × 2.5 mm 圆 / 60×60 方</td></tr>
          <tr><td>2030</td><td>2.5 m / 3.0 m</td><td>50 × 150</td><td>5.0</td><td>60 × 2.5 mm 圆 / 80×80 方</td></tr>
          <tr><td>2430</td><td>2.5 m / 3.0 m</td><td>50 × 150</td><td>5.0</td><td>80 × 3.0 mm 圆 / 80×80 方</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">涂层选项</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>镀锌 + 聚酯喷塑</strong>（RAL 6005 绿、7016 灰、9005 黑）— 标准配置，户外 10–15 年质保</li>
        <li><strong>仅热镀锌</strong> — 银色，用于公用事业/农业</li>
        <li>涂层系统总厚度通常 100–130 µm；首单要求涂层厚度检测报告</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">完整系统组件</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>网片（带折弯——通常每片 2、3 或 4 个折弯）</li>
        <li>立柱 + 柱帽，带焊接支架或夹板</li>
        <li>夹具/螺栓、柱帽，有时带刺丝滚笼支架</li>
        <li>门：单开 1.0–1.5 m，双开至 6 m——涂层需与网片匹配</li>
      </ol>
      <p>按<strong>每延米完整系统</strong>报价，不要只报网片——立柱和配件占项目成本 30–40%。</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">价格参考</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">产品</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">规格</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">价格范围 (USD/片)</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">MOQ</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">交货期</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">3D 网片，1.03m 高</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50×200mm, 3.5mm 丝, RAL6005</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$8–14/片</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">100 片</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15–20 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">3D 网片，1.53m 高</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50×200mm, 4.0mm 丝, RAL6005</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$12–18/片</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">100 片</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15–20 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">3D 网片，1.83m 高</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50×200mm, 4.5mm 丝, RAL7016</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$15–22/片</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">100 片</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15–25 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">358 防爬网</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">76.2×12.7mm, 4.0mm 丝</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$45–75/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">20–30 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">立柱 (1.53m, 60×60mm)</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">2.0mm 壁厚, 涂层</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$8–12/根</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">100 根</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15–20 天</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted mb-6">*2025–2026 年指示性价格范围。实际价格取决于丝材成本、涂层系统、订单量和目的港。请务必索取包含完整系统明细的正式报价。</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">常见问题</h2>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">3D 护栏网片 FOB 价格多少？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">大致 USD 8–15/片（1.53m 高喷塑），取决于丝径和订单量。整柜（500+ 片）价格最优。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">每柜能装多少片？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">40'高柜约装 700–900 片 1.53m 高（钢托盘包装）加立柱。要求工厂提供装载方案。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">符合安防标准吗？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">标准 3D 护栏是威慑型，不能防剪切。高安防要求请选 358 防爬网（76.2×12.7mm, 4mm 丝）——安平也生产。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">有哪些颜色可选？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">标准 RAL 颜色：6005（苔绿）、7016（石墨灰）、9005（黑）、9010（白）、8017（棕）。定制 RAL 颜色需更长交期，可能有起订量。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">3D 护栏如何安装？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">立柱浇筑混凝土（通常埋深 30–40 cm）。网片用夹板或焊接支架通过 M8 螺栓固定。网片底部留 5–10 cm 间隙。多数供应商提供安装图纸。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">2D 和 3D 护栏有什么区别？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary"><strong>3D：</strong>V 型折弯增加刚性，丝径较轻（3.5–5mm），最常用。<strong>2D：</strong>平面，丝径更粗（5–8mm），更强但更重更贵。3D 适合大多数商业/住宅；2D 用于高安防或重载。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">如何规划护栏集装箱运输？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">使用我们的<a href="/zh/tools/container-loading-calculator/" class="text-theme-accent">集装箱装载计算器</a>——选择"护栏网片"产品类型，输入尺寸和数量。网片通常用钢托盘或金属带捆包装。</p>
      </details>

      <div class="not-prose mt-8 bg-theme-secondary text-white rounded-xl p-6">
        <p class="font-semibold text-lg">获取安平护栏工厂报价</p>
        <a href="/zh/inquiry/" class="inline-block mt-3 accent-bg hover:accent-bg font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg transition-colors">发送询盘 →</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Sidebar -->
    <aside class="lg:w-80 shrink-0">
      <div class="sticky top-24 space-y-6">
        <!-- Quick Tools -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">快速工具</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">计算与转换</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/tools/welded-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 重量计算器
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/tools/container-loading-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 集装箱装载
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/tools/fob-price-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> FOB 价格计算器
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/charts/mesh-size-chart/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 规格表
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick Specs -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">快速规格</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">护栏网片标准</h3>
          <dl class="space-y-2 text-xs">
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">高度</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">1.03–2.43 m</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">网片宽度</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">2.5 / 3.0 m</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">开孔</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">50×150<br/>50×200 mm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">丝径</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">3.0–5.0 mm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">涂层</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">Zn + 喷塑<br/>100–130 µm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">颜色</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">RAL 6005/7016<br/>9005/9010</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>

        <!-- Related Products -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">相关产品</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">相关产品</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/products/welded-wire-mesh/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 焊接网
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/products/stainless-steel-wire-mesh/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 不锈钢丝网
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/products/gabion-baskets/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 石笼网
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Base>
